# Block root body spacing

After the `<block …>` opening tag, leave **one blank line** before the first child (`<name>`, `<type>`, …).

```xml
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  …>
  <name>Face</name>
  <type>mbtype:Face</type>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  …>

  <name>Face</name>
  <type>mbtype:Face</type>
```

Separates the xmlns header from the identity block. Do not insert extra blank lines.
